{"id":"A2-L036","title":"Future: going to — introduction","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U03","focus":"Future — going to — introdução","targets":{"grammar":"Future — going to — introdução","pron":"Plural e 3ª pessoa /s/ /z/ /ɪz/","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["smoothie","blend","ginger","oats","almond","kale","nutrition","almond milk","chia seeds","frozen berries","straw","ice cubes","protein powder","thick","creamy","refreshing"],"field":"Saúde cotidiana","genre":"Receita e instruções","skill":"Escrita","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 36 · Future: going to — introduction","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Future — going to — introdução.","**Pronúncia:** Plural e 3ª pessoa /s/ /z/ /ɪz/.","**10 palavras novas** (saúde cotidiana).","**Texto do dia:** receita e instruções."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo falar de planos e intenções com going to e ler uma receita saudável."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **escrever frases claras e corretas (IELTS Writing, TOEFL Writing)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["smoothie","vitamina"],["blend","bater no liquidificador"],["ginger","gengibre"],["oats","aveia"],["almond","amêndoa"],["kale","couve"],["nutrition","nutrição"],["almond milk","almond milk"],["chia seeds","chia seeds"],["frozen berries","frozen berries"],["straw","straw"],["ice cubes","ice cubes"],["protein powder","protein powder"],["thick","thick"],["creamy","creamy"],["refreshing","refreshing"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A recipe","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Healthy Smoothie: What We’re Going to Do","paras":["Tomorrow we **are going to make** a green smoothie. We **are going to blend** spinach, banana and yogurt. I **am going to add** a little ginger, and my sister **is not going to add** sugar.","Then we **are going to drink** it before school. Are you **going to try** it?"],"kicker":"RECIPE","by":"Health notebook","gloss":[["blend","bater no liquidificador"],["spinach","espinafre"],["ginger","gengibre"],["smoothie","vitamina"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"They are going to make a smoothie.","ans":"T","why":"going to make."},{"q":"They are going to add sugar.","ans":"F","why":"not going to add."},{"q":"They will drink it before school.","ans":"T","why":"before school."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“blend” = ?","opts":["bater no liquidificador","cortar","ferver"],"ans":0,"why":"blend."},{"q":"“spinach” = ?","opts":["espinafre","alface","couve"],"ans":0,"why":"spinach."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Future: be going to","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Forma","Exemplo"],"rows":[["afirmativa","**I am going to cook.**"],["negativa","**She isn’t going to add sugar.**"],["pergunta","**Are you going to try it?**"],["resposta curta","**Yes, I am. / No, I’m not.**"]],"cap":"Future: be going to"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Usamos para **planos** e **previsões com evidência**: *Look at those clouds! It’s going to rain.*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I ___ to make a smoothie. (am going)","a":"am going","why":"be going to."},{"s":"She ___ to add sugar. (not)","a":"isn’t going","why":"neg."},{"s":"___ you going to try it? (Are)","a":"Are","why":"pergunta."},{"s":"We are going to ___ spinach. (blend)","a":"blend","why":"verbo base."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["smoothie","vitamina"],["blend","bater no liquidificador"],["spinach","espinafre"],["ginger","gengibre"],["blender","li